## Client (`client/src/`)

### Entry & shell

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `main.tsx` | React root: mounts `QueryClientProvider`, `BrowserRouter`, and `<App />`. |
| `App.tsx` | Top-level layout (header, tab navigation) and route definitions. |

### Pages

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `pages/PlayersPage.tsx` | Lists squad players, triggers CHPP refresh. Uses React Query. |
| `pages/PlayerDetailPage.tsx` | Single-player view: skills, position ratings, position-override form. Uses React Query. |
| `pages/MarketStudiesPage.tsx` | Lists market studies, allows creating new ones; sub-nav to Analytics. Uses React Query. |
| `pages/MarketStudyInfoPage.tsx` | Single study: editable name/search params, summary metrics, CHPP refresh and remove non-sold; link to Analytics. |
| `pages/MarketAnalyticsPage.tsx` | Multi-study analytics: filters, sold-only charts (age double-bar, specialty, skill), results table with status filter (default listed). |
| `pages/PriceModelPage.tsx` | Price prediction model management: view status, train/retrain the model. |
| `pages/TrainingPage.tsx` | Squad training view: program selector, dumbbell progress table, last-match minutes. |

### Hooks

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `hooks/useMarketStudy.ts` | `useMarketStudyData` — fetches a study, `reload()` refetch, action handlers. `useStudyFilters` — filter/sort state for the results table. |
| `hooks/useAnalyticsData.ts` | `useAnalyticsStudyQueries` — loads study list + parallel study details and merged predictions for the analytics page. |
| `hooks/usePriceModel.ts` | React Query hooks for price model: `usePriceModelStatus` (status + train mutation), `usePlayerPrediction`, `useStudyPredictions`. |
| `hooks/useTraining.ts` | Training program selection (localStorage + API), progress query. |

